### Classification rules

The rules apply in the order listed; the first rule that matches decides. `road_side` rules apply to the sides of a road, `standalone` rules to separately mapped ways, `any` rules to both. On a road side, `cycleway` and `cycleway:*` are the side's own tags, `sidewalk_bicycle` is the side's `sidewalk:*:bicycle` value, and `road:*` are tags of the road itself. Names in angle brackets are value lists of the classifier file.

